<p>Rethread the timeline, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">140, 188, 226, 258, 286</acronym> temporal damage to the target before moving on to a second target.</p><p>Rethread can hit up to 3 targets up to 10 grids apart, and will never hit the same one twice; nor will it hit the caster.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>